{"3143880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Industrial Empire", "steam_appid": 3143880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3275310], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small industry. Buy and sell products, request shipments from your industries and hands-on load/unload pallets. Fulfill orders and reinvest profits to expand your business. Scale your operation from a small trader to full-fledged industrial empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase and upgrade industries to produce products.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade product production and price to maximize profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate market and control demand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase shares of rivals for passive income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your own way to the top.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hands-on Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate your forklift to manually load and unload pallets, move goods through your warehouse, and handle shipments yourself. Every decision matter: your hands-on actions impact your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Market</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The market reacts to supply and demand. Buy low, sell high, and watch prices fluctuate based on your and rival companies' actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Growth and Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your products and industries to increase efficiency and profit. Every upgrade opens new strategies and opportunities to dominate the market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths to success: focus on trading, production, or a balanced approach. No two runs play exactly the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge / Risk</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against AI rivals who will buy shares, manipulate markets, and expand their operations. Can you outsmart them and rise to the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Outcomes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you go bankrupt or own 100% of all of your rivals?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small industry. Buy and sell products, request shipments from your industries and hands-on load/unload pallets. Fulfill orders and reinvest profits to expand your business. Scale your operation from a small trader to full-fledged industrial empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase and upgrade industries to produce products.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade product production and price to maximize profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate market and control demand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase shares of rivals for passive income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your own way to the top.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hands-on Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate your forklift to manually load and unload pallets, move goods through your warehouse, and handle shipments yourself. Every decision matter: your hands-on actions impact your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Market</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The market reacts to supply and demand. Buy low, sell high, and watch prices fluctuate based on your and rival companies' actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Growth and Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your products and industries to increase efficiency and profit. Every upgrade opens new strategies and opportunities to dominate the market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths to success: focus on trading, production, or a balanced approach. No two runs play exactly the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge / Risk</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against AI rivals who will buy shares, manipulate markets, and expand their operations. Can you outsmart them and rise to the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Outcomes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you go bankrupt or own 100% of all of your rivals?</p>", "short_description": "Build and expand your industrial empire. Invest in industries and companies, manage supply chains, and operate your forklift hands-on to handle inventory, shipments, and sales.", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143880/70f134657f60f74281a938a75985ea412d23c83e/header.jpg?t=1773082329", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143880/4ef2b8fa27098067c380e9a49ead6b0575a68dd9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773082329", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143880/4ef2b8fa27098067c380e9a49ead6b0575a68dd9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773082329", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 / Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 960 / RX 470 (2GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p 60FPS Low Settings</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-8400 / Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 / RX